<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>KINZA Internal Tools</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --navy: #1e1c32;
    --gold: #caa03a;
    --body: #292929;
    --paper: #fbf7f3;
    --rose: #af7373;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--body);
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .header {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 2rem 2rem 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .header::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
  }
  .wordmark {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .header-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(251,247,243,0.55);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 80px; }
  .intro { font-size: 14px; color: #5a5a5a; margin-bottom: 36px; max-width: 520px; }
  .menu { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
  .card {
    display: block;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e5ddc9;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 24px 26px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .card:hover { border-color: var(--gold); }
  .card-title {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .card-desc { font-size: 13.5px; color: #666; line-height: 1.5; }
  .arrow { color: var(--gold); font-size: 18px; }
  .external-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rose);
    border: 1px solid var(--rose);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="header">
    <div class="wordmark">K I N Z A</div>
    <div class="header-sub">Internal Tools</div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="intro">Reference tools for how the client pipeline actually runs, and how to file internal documents correctly. Both stay live and get updated as the systems evolve.</p>

    <div class="menu">

      <a class="card" href="pipeline.html">
        <div class="card-title">Client Pipeline Automation Map <span class="arrow">→</span></div>
        <div class="card-desc">Every stage from Qualified Lead through Active billing — what's built, what's still pending a decision, and exactly how each automation is configured.</div>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="https://claude.ai/chat/45ac60b8-ce94-41e3-a03b-f9474b85e943" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="card-title">Filing Assistant <span class="arrow">↗</span></div>
        <div class="card-desc">Describe, paste, or upload a document and get the correct HQ folder and filename back, following the Internal Folder Index &amp; Filing Guide.</div>
        <span class="external-tag">Opens in Claude</span>
      </a>

    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
